{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>The unwalled towns.</b> Like חדלו פרזון (Judges 5:7)." "<b>and sending.</b> An adjective from the heavy [binyan], augmented by the addition of mem. We find הנני משליח בך (1 Samuel 15:1)." "<b>Portions.</b> Parts, like מנה אחת אפים (Exodus 16:18)."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {1 "The comparison to הנני משליח בך supports identifying משלח as a piel/participle-type form; 'heavy binyan' refers to the doubled middle letter pattern."}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:22.285714734Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}